{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4eb77d23dc177f0f7133910535dde0b98a9de67689fdcb514b373555554c2412", "ja": "結婚式の勉強のためブライダルフェアに参加\nする風花達。試食会の後、風花達の話題は結\n婚感や理想の結婚相手のことに。優しい人が\n理想だと話す風花と歌織に、環は、それなら\nプロデューサーはどうかと提案する。", "zh": "风花等人为了研究婚礼而去参加婚纱展。\n试吃会结束后，一行人聊起婚姻观和\n理想的结婚对象。听到风花与歌织表示\n喜欢温柔的人，环提议可以考虑制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f2f65d73c18c985773827a5baaaa1d742ad51f9e418c239089334d7b79cb336", "ja": "（今日は『ハピマリ』の編集部さんが、アイドル達を\nブライダルフェアに招待してくれた）", "zh": "（今天，『幸福婚礼』的编辑部\n招待偶像们去参加婚纱展。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "26ebf7d5bbc7cf34a08e84bf5cb10b0431d74f2f65bcd88cec3e8eae5b3d80ab", "ja": "すっごくすてきな式場だね！\nわたしもこういうところで結婚式したいな～。", "zh": "好漂亮的婚礼会场！\n我也想在这种地方办婚礼呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "f310a8db0b4a1ebbedd1c05e936cc4c8590c18e0b6dea64b346b0c68a5debcfe", "ja": "おー！　キラキラしててスゴいぞ～！\n育、ももこ、探検しよー！", "zh": "哦──！闪闪发亮的好壮观喔～！\n育、桃子，我们去探险吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "56dc4f7b78d0d49268acb0e2dce10c60534b22c59a67798ced1bf49b82a0399b", "ja": "あんまりはしゃいじゃダメだよ。\n桃子たち、お仕事で来たんだから。", "zh": "不可以兴奋过头了，\n桃子我们是来工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "5ef3313bb1320bb82aa53a95606b8bed50cdad3e22a6461ce298f634922a1064", "ja": "えっと……たまきたち、ベールガール？　っていうのに\nなるから、もぎ何とかを見て勉強するんだっけ？", "zh": "呃……环我们好像要负责一份叫「花童」的工作，\n所以是要看一个模拟什么的做研究？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "76d8aa05d9d38d20db2de351a33c9b1d25d35951a2d4a25f907fc57fb6c509db", "ja": "そうよ、模擬挙式っていうのを見せてもらって、\n結婚式ってどんなものなのか、勉強させてもらうの。", "zh": "没错，要请对方让我们观摩模拟婚礼，\n研究婚礼到底是什么样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9ddc3d04b1480e7a6c110a97b01a0a3ac738deb40c1f3a1e1c5cd0e6454fa580", "ja": "これからの撮影にも役立つだろうし、\nみんなで結婚式についてしっかりと勉強しような。", "zh": "这个应该也会在之后的拍摄派上用场，\n大家一起好好研究婚礼相关的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7ff81f910cf753061fa41786ac5d879655102ba6071cf4c58e72def1dd0fa2b", "ja": "あとで、お料理の試食会も\n体験させてもらえるんですよね？", "zh": "待会还有能体验餐点的试吃会对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9195bbc634cbc07f0c712f01f381abfd45593c1dfcae56f3de156548da52d185", "ja": "ああ、元五つ星ホテルのシェフによる、\nフレンチのフルコースが食べられるそうだぞ。", "zh": "嗯，听说能吃到前五星餐厅主厨\n所做的法式全餐喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "42c2324870988d9f535dc9feb5a6c8109f25d58a1e9712bb4750263e316f70cc", "ja": "わあ、フレンチのフルコースかぁ……。\n楽しみだけど、カロリーも高そう……。", "zh": "哇～法式全餐啊……\n期待归期待，但卡路里应该很高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "fd0492dd63a8dfa199082e2ba0874c4a7f1b0c6b5113602b992246fef841e9ba", "ja": "ふうか、フレンチきらいなの？\n食べられなかったら、たまきが食べてあげる？", "zh": "风花，你讨厌吃法国菜吗？\n不敢吃的话，要不要环帮你吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "da559832f72532fe72288fa8fa704f18e7fc5ebaeaa7f64e3ac152426eb56a3b", "ja": "あ、ありがとう環ちゃん。……でも、大丈夫。\nダイエットは明日からにするね！", "zh": "谢、谢谢你，小环……\n不过，没关系，减肥是明天的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "8865ebb2b8de21e59cbbb64fe7a4b4de502981dc88aa9a9ed5dba5e034beffb8", "ja": "そのほうがいいと思うよ。食べたいときには\nいっぱい食べたほうが、元気になれるんだって！", "zh": "我也觉得这么做比较好。\n想吃的时候尽量吃，才会有活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "a1c43a0496faccbb846eb0e447324c7809d00767323626beef101df927f5cd95", "ja": "あっ！　あっちにも何かありそう！\nおやぶん！　たまき、ちょっと見てくるね！", "zh": "啊！那边好像也有什么东西！\n老大！环过去看一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac860d6c47d0859ab9f9b4cc1e176ee3e3c89c79a0ce1cd8b5df5f045fc8de8a", "ja": "あっ、環！　式場で走っちゃダメだってば！\n……もう、子どもなんだから。", "zh": "啊、环！不可以在会场里奔跑啦！\n……真是小孩子耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "7dd05e5fbc404116024299fd29294203cc8933cee47ae03c2267d0f2d57761c2", "ja": "ふふっ、3人とも、本当の姉妹みたいですね。\n桃子ちゃんが、しっかり者のお姉さんで。", "zh": "呵呵！你们三个人好像真正的姊妹呢，\n桃子是可靠的大姊姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ad2288f8d9c94ac2a2b30c171b202d810dc7231798821d56071b59f59564ad4d", "ja": "はは、そうですね。\n一番年上は環だった気もしますが……。", "zh": "哈哈，对啊。\n虽然环年纪是最大的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "72ef52df7468cf2d6eae9c2e70ead9f5c089a7039fba3acbe27d24cdc5287821", "ja": "（その後。俺達は館内や模擬挙式を見学し、\n試食会でのフルコース料理を楽しませてもらった）", "zh": "（之后，我们参观了馆内和模拟婚礼，\n并且在试吃会享用了全餐。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0235656ea3eede55af7526c743b31100569b127c52e4f94c5aba3456000de82", "ja": "はぁ、すっごく美味しかったですね！\nもうお腹いっぱいです♪　……あ。お腹……。", "zh": "呼～真的很好吃呢！\n吃得肚子好饱♪……啊，肚子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3161eb70acf39cf74a45d8837da7abc7a80084dc339adc69a10dfe19e77a17af", "ja": "うう、これからモデルをするんだし。ブライダルエステ\nじゃないけど、がんばらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "呜呜，毕竟之后要当模特儿，\n虽然不用做到婚前保养，但还是得努力减重……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "474a188c3b5be84ac34fe30110832a6264a169ce915fe469ece31d9901222068", "ja": "ウェディングドレスを着る時は、最高の自分でいたい\nものね……。風花ちゃん、一緒にがんばりましょうね！", "zh": "大家都希望穿上婚纱的自己是最完美的……\n风花，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "34bb7dbbc5778a98c5ad00d7770fa808877586149e1d65698129f4ceb1acc20a", "ja": "……心意気はありがたいんですが、\nふたりは今のままでも大丈夫じゃないですか？", "zh": "……你们有这个决心我是很高兴，\n但你们现在这样不是就很好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "c09f6365d09fff8c5e10bfaf44b375b679daf612c9d32066f48c89965631de98", "ja": "大丈夫じゃありませんっ。", "zh": "一点都不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8b9204ee9800719523d4002ffc576ebcff68f39a6ab7c2e68912aa8e26895b33", "ja": "大丈夫じゃないです～！", "zh": "才不好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1243bd5f8ae55a3563d969f1d442642a16fbb0efff45fde7765454a74abcc379", "ja": "そ、そうですか、すみません！", "zh": "这、这样啊，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "73dbf827286c85151739b4bfd543149b14a6c224a308588e25ec48f4a1c3196d", "ja": "お嫁さん、いいなぁ～。\nたまきも結婚したい！", "zh": "新娘好棒喔～\n环也想结婚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e85853a927200eb3609a3faa2dc11e3136f8ec592ab5c70d790f2bc999ea5c6e", "ja": "た、環は環でなんてことを！", "zh": "环、环你怎么会这么想！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "35c17367893d9f1918ce9bc8272e3d91786fb358da9ad0e22bf861e5f73df5bd", "ja": "だって、お父さんとお母さん、\n毎日ニコニコしてるもん。ぜったい楽しいぞ～。", "zh": "因为爸爸妈妈每天都笑咪咪的啊，\n结婚一定很开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "80c80ba402ad7599bff4fc187c5b2927085f9a69a47166c34abf95e127d90811", "ja": "桃子は、結婚なんて考えられないかな。\nだって桃子は女優だし、アイドルだもん。", "zh": "桃子根本不会想要结婚耶。\n因为桃子是女演员，还是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "df4fc997a3afdb279500290cdb7349f2bd43bab9bda39c7a34840fca5716c5e9", "ja": "プロとして、プライベートの恋愛より\nお仕事優先なのはトーゼンだよ。ね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "身为专业人士，把工作放在个人恋爱前面\n是理所当然的，对不对，大哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4f7eb14930cb3952fda0a293870c0dba214ef7419c81bb66464cc3d61317ad2b", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。桃子に言われると複雑だけど、\n桃子のいう通りだ。", "zh": "是、是啊……虽然从桃子口中听到\n让人心情有点复杂，但你说的没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "eacf3829a5a8fa4050fc3817d8d7530e4762a5f3e708beb9d06f73612bc2c2b6", "ja": "わたしは結婚してもいいけど、\n相手はわたしとおなじくらい、収入がある人がいいな。", "zh": "我是可以结婚，\n但对方的收入最好要跟我差不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c74f1be073d4962a5f87bb1bd5688663b83ffe75cdb7885c0702cf4ab48ce21", "ja": "わたしに頼りきりになるのは、よくないからね。\nそんけいしあえる関係でなくちゃ！", "zh": "不然对方一直依赖我，这样不太好。\n必须要是互相尊重的关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "74bdd7a1446418ec1cc728ceba73f4605394a5f13710fd1f05a38eb7d297c197", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nシビアなんだな、育は。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n育真严格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eb89579fb197b365d82053472d431ac0d8b301a74be5bf01aea202fb3e92dede", "ja": "すごいなぁ……。私より桃子ちゃん達の方が、\nしっかり考えてるみたい。", "zh": "真了不起……跟我比起来，\n桃子她们好像都认真地考虑过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9f199eafe4b31ccb193812a47af0cbc96241b641a96df902e357e92154eeff91", "ja": "私はただ、ウェディングドレスに憧れてただけで。\n現実的に考えたことなんて、あんまり……。", "zh": "我只是梦想能穿上婚纱，\n并没有思考太多现实层面的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "88b541e90ee2299ed255b997464ec961a1c9cdbb5bd1787872b86160627715cc", "ja": "私も同じかなぁ……。あ、風花ちゃんのお家には、\nお見合いのお話とかは来ないの？", "zh": "我也一样……啊，风花家里\n没有人来介绍相亲之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2e293e1bd92f65879f807805231ca50a525a74607a97c778b276a4dea060822", "ja": "お見合いですか！？　えっと、冗談で言われることが\nあるくらいで……って、歌織さんには来るんですか！？", "zh": "相亲吗！？嗯……只有开玩笑似地说过……\n呃，难道歌织家有吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1038_052kao", "source_sha256": "980d61ef62115f1f2a855a053cbf641458398c5ce93d4839b1b671e40884869c", "ja": "そうみたい……だけど、父が全部断ってるんですって。\n結婚はまだ早い、認めない！　って。", "zh": "好像有……但是我父亲全部拒绝了。\n他说我要结婚还太早，所以不认可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "4c25bddd504ce799d9b102709302eaf23a9d8c4a6480b03e8ea8fb12a5786739", "ja": "まだまだ子供扱いなの。\n……困ってしまいますね。", "zh": "他一直把我当小孩子看待……\n真的很伤脑筋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "f11427198bd83b4eb7b3e00b46505e145b924b0fd6904841ed6d976a38507e2d", "ja": "そ、そうですね。\nプロデューサーとしては困りませんが……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，\n站在制作人的角度是不会伤脑筋啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e2bfd243589be71a508f76275a82d3badb1c1417bc0b0cdff56529617410b80f", "ja": "あ、もしかしたらお父さんは、歌織さんに、\nずっとそばにいて欲しいだけかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "啊，或许令尊只是希望\n歌织可以一直陪在自己身边呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "a59bbeb3404eed3835040abcb16a78b683a04e48890096c10dbd37940b980f7e", "ja": "ふふっ、どうかしら。\nそばに……ずっとそばに、かぁ。", "zh": "呵呵，谁知道呢。\n陪在身边……一直陪在身边啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1043_052kao", "source_sha256": "7dbbd6c6fb00fdff55c7d26be4442e69f2411a8c6a58e7650d804c005360045a", "ja": "風花ちゃんは、もし結婚するとしたら、\nどんな人がいいって思うの？", "zh": "假如要结婚的话，\n风花觉得什么样的人比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "290e2a508edcbc61eb6b977659b3ebdcaadc59788113d30f35eea3fbff3e8312", "ja": "ええっ？　そ、そうですね。えっと……。\n優しくて、誠実で、その、ちゃんと私を見てくれて……", "zh": "咦咦？这、这个嘛，我想想……\n温柔、诚恳，嗯～会用心照顾我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "096b527aad383cfef2b4eb24299ba3f255b3b2755859abcf24e81b48e5833ecc", "ja": "って、なんだか恥ずかしくなってきちゃいました！\nあの～、歌織さんは？", "zh": "呃，突然觉得好害羞！\n那～歌织呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1046_052kao", "source_sha256": "3d38f62c011bc17c6b753c029445901b3a871808e9275528b5064733e4ec1dac", "ja": "私は……私が甘えても、包み込んでくれる人、かな？\n私をしっかりと、受けとめてくれて……。", "zh": "我的话……即使我撒娇也能包容我的人吧？\n愿意完整地接纳我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "1876fa35b564a0cc136a0a53617918fc0169dd3e31b86a3a7c9d1ae3220cef2a", "ja": "ふふっ、私も恥ずかしくなっちゃった。\n結局、風花ちゃんと同じで優しい人ってことなのかも。", "zh": "呵呵！我也觉得害羞起来了。\n结果我跟风花一样，好像都喜欢温柔的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c4b97087a022003e982e4794c51df8c359fa8774d374ae35b3fda4eae78fe9f", "ja": "かおりもふうかも、やさしい人がいいの？\nじゃあ、おやぶんは？", "zh": "歌织跟风花都喜欢温柔的人吗？\n那老大怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "66e659a5d105d09f5545aca8460e6c9b9c2087e8c35b63197156c94f4f11d3cd", "ja": "（ええっ！？）", "zh": "（咦咦！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1052_040tam", "source_sha256": "046e2dc17f2e42972d9e01600dee47ad12aa4278840de9ccffd4d19b4cacfcab", "ja": "おやぶんはやさしいぞ！　\n一緒にこぶんと遊んでくれるんだ～。ねっ、おやぶん！", "zh": "老大很温柔喔！\n他会陪小弟一起玩～对不对，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "5e4ffb7e33c5974b3015191a193785976727805b8d4330e95ffde47488242950", "ja": "そ、そうだな、こぶんには優しいほうだと……。\nおおっと！　もうこんな時間だ！", "zh": "这、这个嘛，我对小弟是挺好的……\n喔喔！已经这个时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1054_052kao", "source_sha256": "c8be061e5b69bacc7e2d92bddb4d027f162c82b021662c02668be4d4aa9f4bbb", "ja": "ま、まあ！　みんな、早く戻りましょうね！\nさあ、急ぎましょう！", "zh": "也、也对！大家，要赶快回去啰！\n好了，我们快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "191107801e46db67609b5fe1347a4cfda207ac090d3f428d8b6b4bcd00ecbd63", "ja": "そ、そうそう、遅くなったら大変！\nはい、いきますよ～！", "zh": "没、没错，弄得太晚就糟了！\n好，我们走啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1057_030iku", "source_sha256": "af2c055e44388b3a93b00ca2fccedeefb839df08da87e1b1971d3f10e8b920b6", "ja": "なんだか{$P$}さんたち、\nみんな顔がまっかだったね。びっくりしちゃった！", "zh": "总觉得{$P$}先生他们\n每个人脸都好红喔，吓我一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "7378e9d2da13eb4ee1890b06a02f542bdb8484adc232d8557cda085d72d69c15", "ja": "ふん、デレデレしちゃって……。\nさ、桃子たちも行こ！", "zh": "哼，在那边害羞什么……\n好了，桃子我们也走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0091_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_02_1056_040tam", "source_sha256": "00f292e09c627a96f571f41527257eb31343b4d118f158ee103c21fad9699bcc", "ja": "あ、まってよ、おやぶん～！\nかおりとふうかも～！", "zh": "啊，等一下啦，老大～！\n歌织跟风花也等等啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
